		{
			dependencies: ["1654EA4BC9A74F79"]
			description: [
				"A &eSolar Panel&r loves a void world - no clouds below, no caves above. Free daytime FE for your outposts, on any planet with a sun."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the right generator for off-world bases.&r Your Moon or Mars outpost cannot easily run cables home, and hauling fuel across the solar system is miserable. Solar needs nothing shipped in."
				""
				"&e&lIt only produces in daylight&r, so pair every panel with an &7Energy Cube&r or battery to carry the base through the night. On the Moon the night is long and hostile - a base that loses power after dark loses its oxygen distributor too."
				""
				"&c&lOutput varies by planet.&r Closer to the sun is stronger - Mercury and Venus are excellent, Glacio is poor. Plan the outpost's power around where it actually is."
				""
				"&7On your home island they are still worth building. No terrain shadows anything, so a roof of panels runs at full output all day.&r"
				""
				"&8Combine with wind generators at home: solar covers the day, wind never stops. Between them you rarely need to burn anything."
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:solar_panel"
			id: "2D5C000000000001"
